v style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༾༢༊༱༤༡༒༺༙༓༃༖༥༒༄༅༴༮༸༵༷༚༽༕༐༢༩༩ༀ༤༷༜༑༻ༀ༛༇༱༫༂༼༫༚༲༕༕༙༄༁༼༒༩༘༅༰༪༹༬༊༜༥༤༯༅༐༸༾༜༕༺༅༦༙༾༜༥༪༗༼</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1351.29,"y":167.3,"cell":5471,"i":300,"name":"Masivak Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠏𐠕\ud802𐠑\udc34\ud802𐠎𐠬\udc1e\udc0e\ud802\ud802𐠐𐠠𐠣\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠝𐠟\udc1c𐠜\udc24\ud802𐠂\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠓𐠝\udc04𐠔𐠕\udc15\udc18\ud802\ud802 𐠒𐠨\ud802 𐠳</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1336.48,"y":320.13,"cell":20544,"i":301,"name":"Wittnaunin Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ገነሀፀከገተኀደገአረመ ገገቀነአነፐሰ ተከደሀተሰሠነአኀሠሠጰ ፐከሠጠ ሀፐቀሠ ጰበተሀፀጰሐ ወዐሰበመሰ ኀ ከ ፈረጠ ተሐቀጸለሐቀቀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":147.65,"y":965.52,"cell":93173,"i":302,"name":"Son Thanh Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳏ⳾ⲲⳜⳔⲸⲼⳒⳂⳖⳞⳜⳤⳂⳂⳃⳌ⳧⳧ⳁⳞⳀⲾ⳥ⳤⲲ⳧ⳈⳂⲸⳃⳖⲸ⳾ⳜⲼⳃⲼⲲⳂⳚⳞⲲⳤⳊⳬⲴ ⳖⳘ⳥ⳀⳈⲸⲴⲾ⳧ⳬⲲⳚ⳹⳾ⳫⳐⳆ⳪ⳚⲾⳄ⳥ⳘⲸ⳩ⳬⳄⳖⳂⳀⳊⳞⳠⳔⲴⳈⳈⲾⳐⳐⳠⳈⳐⳔⳬⳒⳜⳃ⳧Ⳗ⳧</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":541.6,"y":729.4,"cell":76993,"i":303,"name":"Bjerdur Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ተዘሠለኀፐኀፈፈጸሀበከቀሀሐ  ፈሀበመለ ረኀጸሀሐኀተበሀቀፐ ፀቀፐ ከጸኀአፀ ሀኀመረጠሀሐሰደነ  ጸረቀረጠጰሀዘኀሠተጰገነፀሠሰቀከለከጠቀአነ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":922.6,"y":295.13,"cell":17795,"i":304,"name":"Nererensk Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">  ገሀጸፈበዐሠከዐዐሰቀሀሠ ጠቀከረመገፐ  ቀፀጸቀወለአመሠዘኀቀቀዐዐገሀገቀ  ገዘነነኀሀነአተ ገተሀፐደደዐጰነጸጠዘአረየሐ ሀየጠለሠ </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1474.24,"y":536.24,"cell":59661,"i":305,"name":"Gazd Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc26\udc01\udc0d𐠙\udc23\udc2b\ud802\ud802𐠱\udc1f\udc1a\ud802𐠡\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠦\udc0c\udc21𐠂\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠗𐠁 \ud802\ud802𐠗\udc32\ud802𐠛\ud802𐠔\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":564.77,"y":296.97,"cell":17738,"i":306,"name":"Anghe Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc20\udc19\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠯𐠭\udc35\udc14\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠤\udc2b\ud802\ud802𐠕\ud802𐠒𐠓\ud802𐠴\udc24\udc31\udc30\udc1f\ud802𐠋\ud802𐠊𐠠\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠪\ud802 \ud802𐠘\ud802𐠩 \udc23𐠟\udc1b \ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":175.17,"y":684.27,"cell":75306,"i":307,"name":"Yangzhou Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ተወአወጠዘቀመደተመበፐጸዘአጰኀወበገፐነከወሰፈከጰፀመኀቀከቀወከ ወ በኀቀፐበጠቀኀፀ ለጠሠሰየ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":341.03,"y":132.42,"cell":2337,"i":308,"name":"Bulan Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ተደፀገ ኀሐ ዘደፐገፐ አነፈረ ዘገበጠሐወመጸጠሰተ ጸ ከ ዘዐሐደነሠ  አፈኀወኀ ዐተለደፈተለተሰወፈአ ዐ ዘቀደገመሀሐሰዘበኀሀነከጠፀተፀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":351.59,"y":811.49,"cell":79329,"i":309,"name":"Kavoding Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༄༮༽༧༼༅༭༪༆༅༊༿༃༁༄༆ༀ༊༰༽༑༁ༀ༹༄༕༦༗༲༨༘༯༗༐༧༅༐༿༕༚༕༂༫༦༿༜༊༢༘༵༜༨༬༳༉༵༆༷༠༗༂༩༐་༅༸༼༫</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1245.98,"y":105.85,"cell":1278,"i":310,"name":"Piaat Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፈደሠ ዘፐመአሰጰሐበኀኀዐቀአለመጰአሰአየኀጸፈ በጸዘ በፐኀ መየሐፐዘየሰ ዐጰበፀጸረሰ ተፈቀጰሠጰዐሀወሀጠሀአገገ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":229.76,"y":390.12,"cell":33007,"i":311,"name":"Sadagotosa Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳧Ⳙ ⳫⲴⳊⳜⲴⳄⳲⳚ Ⳡ⳾Ⳁ ⳤ⳧ⳆⲺ⳹ⳂⲼⳐⲸⳈⳃⳢⲾⳫⳃⳎⳜⳫⳬⳜ⳾ⳫⳔⳬⳀⳆⳌⳃⳊ⳪ⳁ⳹⳹ⲺⲾⳖⳃⳎⳂ ⳧Ⳍ Ⲽ⳧ⲾⳒⲾⳎⳒⳫ ⳪Ⳋ⳪Ⲷ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":366.71,"y":639.42,"cell":71552,"i":312,"name":"Tengchang Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ደፐመጸ ዘ ሀወጸቀለሀአወኀ ሐቀዘፐ ፐነዘሰ ሠፈ ወቀጠመሰሠደከዘ ጸአየፐወአሠነሠሐሰ ቀሀሐነዐጸኀ ገጰፐ  ዐጰ መዐገ  ከፈጠፀነገረሐሰተዘጸጰጸወሐመየቀጠበ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":532.13,"y":335.23,"cell":22840,"i":313,"name":"Hyang Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳥ⳃⲸⳢⳜⳚⲾ  ⳤⲸⲸⳎⳆⳂⳃⳂⳀⲼⳂⲼⲼⲴⳈⲲⳠⲸⲺⳀⳠ ⳐⳈ⳩Ⳇ⳾ⳲⳢ⳹ⳃⳁⳐ⳧ⳞⳁⳚⳜⲲⳫ⳾⳥Ⳛ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":402.41,"y":822.3,"cell":79835,"i":314,"name":"Onshofn Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠧᡏᠦᠰᡟᡭᡭᡡ᠑ᠰᢞᡭᢓᡯᠪᡭᡴᡆᠮᢁᢑᢏᠦᢥᢜᢤᢒᠮᢦᠨᡎᡮᡟᡟᠲᡍᡯᡞᡳᠾᠭᡆᢋᠡᡗᡲᡝᡎᡮᠵ᠑ᢏᢂᠭᡕᡀᠦᡴᡰᡭᢓᠠᢋᢤ᠀ᠩᡏᢑᠱᢜᡰᠽᡎᢓᢑᢐ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":385.28,"y":890.84,"cell":85973,"i":315,"name":"Amad Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ወበዘከነ  ተቀፐሀተፐወጠዐመከሰከፀአነተዘወኀመ  ቀፀዐደ ጸሀቀበበሀከኀሐነሀደደደ ለየከተጸ መጸሰሰገጠገከረአጸአ ለፈለለሠነአሀዐሠበፐዘከጸጰሐአ  ዘረጠ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":474,"y":972.44,"cell":93880,"i":316,"name":"Contiatua Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ረተከደለየለሠለጰሠተቀገሀዘወመሰጰገጠሰከበጸሐከተነ ተጰጸከጠዐፈሐፀደፈሐፐሀሰ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":242.5,"y":142.57,"cell":3086,"i":317,"name":"Hosont Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳀⳖ⳹ⲺⳚⳞ⳩ⳚⲺⲶ⳥ⳈⳢⳈ⳹ⳜⳐⲲⲸ⳥Ⳗ⳩ⲼⳘⲲⳃⲴⳬⳈⳆⲲⳃ ⲴⲲⲶⳁⳖⳆⲺⳔⳘⳊ ⳀⲼⲶⲼⲴⳜⳠ ⳘⳒⲾⳖⳊⲲⳞⳆ⳹ⳫⳊⳫ ⳪⳾Ⳅ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":443.4,"y":1149.7,"cell":106713,"i":318,"name":"Chantagalli Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc3f\ud802 \ud802𐠅\ud802 \udc0f\udc1c\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠦𐠯\ud802𐠈\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc1b𐠑𐠓\udc2d\ud802𐠃𐠚\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠠\udc23𐠈\ud802𐠭\udc23\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠊\udc2c\ud802𐠮\udc2c\udc3f\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1619.14,"y":452.65,"cell":45695,"i":319,"name":"Chagmar Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡍᠼᠩᠱᡓᢏᠵᡭ᠐ᡍᢓᠮᢁᡁᡠᡐᡭᠯᠨᡑᡑᢀᡎᠳᢐᡑᡏᢂᢜ᠑ᢋᡜᠩᢓᡑᡆᡮᠭᢜᢏᢀᡯ᠒ᡒᢁᢂᡐᢋ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":394.18,"y":463.31,"cell":47368,"i":320,"name":"Naiyuen Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc2d\udc17\ud802\ud802𐠈\udc32\ud802𐠸\udc12𐠏\udc34\udc33𐠵\ud802𐠪\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠛𐠳\udc12\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠵\ud802\ud802 \udc15\udc23\ud802\ud802𐠴𐠵\udc2c𐠟\udc2f 𐠈\ud802𐠮𐠄\udc04\ud802  𐠢\ud802\ud802 \udc2e𐠩𐠗 \udc0e𐠏𐠯</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":425.13,"y":922.97,"cell":89035,"i":321,"name":"Shamah Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢒᠧᠭᠪᡲᡓ᠀ᢢᢂ᠑᠑ᠱᡁᡝ᠑ᡱᡴᡔᢥᡭᢤᠵᠿᠦᢛᡕᠻᡯᠵᡆᡴᢂᡝᡓᢢᠦᡲᢀᠭᡎᡁᠽᠼᢡᡞᡡᠳᡐᢜᠳᡝᡍᠽᠭᡝᡀᡞᢐᢓᡰᡕᠪᢞᡙᢒᡴᢋᠠᢦᡏᡞᢤᡍᡝᡡᢢ᠀ᡆᢑᢒᠮᡭᡆ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1431.41,"y":413.92,"cell":38227,"i":322,"name":"Schonach Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡟᠩᡒᠮᠽᡭᢤᡍᡎᡠᢞᡡᠨᡞᡎᡁᡍᡗᠠᢥᢤᠮᠿᠽᡲᢦᡐᠳᢜᡞᡙᢒᡮᠵᠰᡀᡑᢥ᠑ᢦᠵᡠᢡᡮᡎᡕᠽᢁᠮᡕᠼᠰ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1307.7,"y":667,"cell":74141,"i":323,"name":"Tormano Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༡༼༫༳༤༻༭་༒༔༧༁༸༁༜༽༐༧༁༙༲༘༊༿༖༼༻༥༚༱་༦༫༠༑༦༖༾༴༗༥༈</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":710.05,"y":1084.18,"cell":102397,"i":324,"name":"Tanga Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠽᡗᡒᢞᢠᠭᠠᢠ᠀᠐ᠲᢁ᠑ᠮᡜᢒᠾᡑᢓ᠐ᡒᡟᢟᠪᠡ᠒ᢤᠧᡏᡎᠯ᠐ᠩᠯ᠀᠀ᢡᢒᡳᡯᡔᡁᢓᠩᡖᡝᡳᢂ᠀ᠦᢋ᠀ᠨᢜᡍᠧ᠑ᢞ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1426.21,"y":894.47,"cell":86361,"i":325,"name":"Amile Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802𐠣𐠥𐠯\udc31\udc0d\ud802𐠨\udc2e\ud802\ud802𐠊\ud802\ud802𐠣\udc38𐠲\udc17\udc0b\udc30\ud802𐠅\udc33𐠒𐠟\udc11𐠴\udc01\ud802𐠐𐠃\ud802𐠿𐠒\udc0d\udc1b\udc1e\ud802𐠑\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠌𐠤\udc0f𐠁</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":240.63,"y":634.75,"cell":70934,"i":326,"name":"Guang Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳧ⳠⲺⳤ ⳲⳆ ⳩ Ⳋ⳥ⳃⳢⲶⳀⳬ⳧ⳃⳐⳢⳁⳫⳭⳎⳜⳀⳫ ⳁ⳹Ⳓ⳪⳩⳹ⳄⳀⳖⲶⳀⳢⳞ⳹Ⳡ⳩ ⲶⳜ⳥Ⳍ ⳫⳊⳆⳈ Ⳬ⳧ⳤⳜ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":885.16,"y":441.84,"cell":43419,"i":327,"name":"Bingham Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳈⳬⳈ⳥ⳆⳂⲲ⳾ⳲⳔ⳾ⳢⲾⲲⳁⳌⳚⳒⳭⳁⳢⳠ⳾ⳌⳐ⳪ⳫⳞ⳥ⳚⳘⳁⳈⳈⳚⲾⳆ⳪ⳠⳔ⳩⳪Ⲵⳃ ⳖⲲⲺⲾ⳪ⳘⲶⳚⳘ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":239.63,"y":692.46,"cell":75759,"i":328,"name":"Huilifeng Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡗᢥᡀᡲᢦᡮᡑᡑᢏᢜ᠑ᠵᡔᠭᡡᠧᠮᢞᡔᡁᡀᠰᡞᠩᡆᠳᠰᠯᠠᢟᢤᡙᠻᢁᠲᡕᡏᠳ᠒ᠼᢦᡝ᠐ᠳᡐᢑᡕᠮᠲᠽᠩᡜᡆᡲᡏᠱᢏᢟᢏᢋᠦ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":446.93,"y":863.17,"cell":83062,"i":329,"name":"Victovionis Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⲿ⳪ⳚⲺⳒ⳾ⲲⳁⲲⳁⳎ Ⲽ⳹  ⳈⳃⳐⳭⳌⳄⳐ ⳠⳠⳖⲸⳲⳠ Ⳁ  Ⲳ⳧ⳢⳲⳘ⳧⳹Ⳳ⳩ⲲⲼⳌⳘ⳪⳾ⳎⳊ⳥Ⳏⳁ⳹Ⳃ⳥ⳠⳒ ⲼⳭⲸ⳥⳩⳥ⳭⲾⲸⳲⲼ⳧ⳜⳀ⳥⳥Ⳅ ⳈⳎⳈⳁⲺⳀ⳥ⲴⳬⳊ ⲾⳁⳄⲺⳜⳈ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":985.57,"y":322.46,"cell":20864,"i":330,"name":"Mstis Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ደሀቀተዐ ረኀሠወጸገሐዘፈሐገከሠጠፈፈ በለጠቀሰመነጰ ሀዐበመወደኀሀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1278.22,"y":153.55,"cell":4178,"i":331,"name":"Qaqorsoq Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳳ ⲺⲴ ⳈⳊ⳩ⳎⳀⲾⳭ⳾Ⳋ⳪Ⲷⳁ Ⳅ⳪Ⲵ ⳲⳭⲴⳘ⳾ⳒⳤⳁⳘⳃⳊⳐ⳹ⳆⳜⳐ ⳠⳒⳌ⳾Ⳡⳃ⳥ⳲⳠⲲⳔⳌ⳾ ⳥ⳈⳘⳬⳊⳞⲼⳈ⳾ⳄⲲⳫⲺ⳩ⳒⲲⲺⳐⳀⳁⳃⳠⳚⳒⲼⳁⳄⳖⳁⳂⳞⳐⳢⳠ⳾ⳠⳢ  Ⳑ⳩Ⳟ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":815.1,"y":560.27,"cell":62772,"i":332,"name":"Thilmalin Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳁⳁ⳩ ⳈⳀⲸ ⳞⳚ ⲶⲸⳂ  Ⳅ⳹ⲺⳎⳈⳬⳈⲼⳊⲺ ⳤⳘⳆ⳪ⳒⳈⳚⳊ⳹ⳊⳤⲸⳚⳂⳄ ⳹ⳔⲶⳢⳒⳚⳖⳜⳂ⳧ⳊⳃⳠⳬⳒⳒⲲⳢⳁⳃⲼⳖⳬⳞⳚⲴ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1017.82,"y":456.44,"cell":46491,"i":333,"name":"Treterwick Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༉༶༣༁་༧༣༰༃༆༻༼༦༢༳༗ༀ༈༂༃༩་༑༺༦༴༠༮༣༚༙༭༅༥༾༧༌༵༲༛༭༆༔༵༡༈༧ༀ༭༉༯༹༩༘༉༹༁༺༧༴༃༺༃༯༪༻༦༚༫༜༺</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":188.65,"y":444.07,"cell":43775,"i":334,"name":"Tohe Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ዘሠከየጰነአኀዐረሠዐ ነጠነሀሐገተ ተሐወሠመጰፀጠፈገአ ኀ ፐጸፈ ነኀጸጸ ሠአለ ሐፐጰወዐ ጰፈየበለለለዘሠደከረሐቀሰዐጰኀደዐደመኀነኀጰከየፀ ዐሀለ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":855.48,"y":680.49,"cell":75052,"i":335,"name":"Yaucalipan Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༭༠༮༪༜༊༐༃༸༗༇༴༯༬༼༸༌༦༕༓༩༸༊༦༷༊༵༦༮༾༅༈༣༻༥༽༯༤༒༸༷༅༃༥༱༁༴༗༨༠༐༊༕༮༥༨༭༣༳༫༶༻༄༠༨༾༬༆༚༪༊༡༮༹༸༉༽༔༅༨༑༪༵༑༇༲༒༥</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1282.57,"y":527.47,"cell":58062,"i":336,"name":"Maried Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳫⲺⳐⳫ⳧Ⳁ⳾ⳄⳤⳂⳎⳁⲶⲸⳞⳠ⳹Ⳋ⳹⳪ⳂⲶⲴⳲⳔⲾⳌⳂⳒⳚⳚⳢⲲ Ⳉ⳥ⳀⳌⳲⲺ Ⳃ⳩⳾ⳤⳚⳂⲼⳫ⳪Ⳝ Ⳏ⳥Ⳝ⳥ⳫⳖ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":545.34,"y":1134.25,"cell":105902,"i":337,"name":"Lodharua Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ⳃⳞⳤⲺⲶⳠⲲⲲⲾⳁ⳪ⳀⳄⳌⳖⳈ⳩ⳂⲲⳊⳌⳌⳲⲶⳄⳘⲸⲾⲺⳄ ⳐⳞ ⳘⳂⳖⳜⳠⳞⳃⳊ⳩ⳎⳬⳢ Ⲳ ⳆⳈⳤⳄⲸⳈⳤ⳩</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":351.87,"y":846.04,"cell":81271,"i":338,"name":"Burmium Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ለዐለሠፐጸወሰአዐ ተሠፀቀጸገረሐጸወሠለጰዘሀገሰዘ አዘሐሀየፀደ ሀየፀፀጰነሰተቀጰፐጸመየፀየየከመአደረሐረፀወሀሐነፀየዐዐፈፐኀ መቀኀበአፈዘሐአጰነፀሠገአወጰ አመሐ ጰሀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1401.83,"y":151.78,"cell":3982,"i":339,"name":"Paasiliaateq Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༊༶༽༯༔༻༊༫༌༨༺༖༛༓༳༌༡༸༘༗༭༐༦༖༤༦༿༭༊༙༜༱༰༨༷༈༲༌༱༰༭༢༪༸༹༄༆༖༊༘༗༗༖༓༤༶༈༛༷</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":805.15,"y":416.09,"cell":38542,"i":340,"name":"Piclif Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳔⳬⲸ ⳎⳤⳌⳖⳀⲺⳀⲴⳬⳞ ⳎⲺ Ⳛ⳧ⳄⳞⲸⳭⳘⳌⳁⳜⳆⲸⳤⳀⳁⳒⲶⳠⳂⳭ Ⳬ⳪ ⳩Ⳟⳤ ⳠⳫⲶⳫⳞ⳪ⳞⲶⲲ⳧Ⳡ⳾ⳚⳒⳌⲸⳢⳭⳤⲸ⳾ⳎⳢⲸⳚ⳹ⲲⳲⳠⳜⳀ⳹ ⳈⳤⲸⳢⲺⲸⳂⳒⳞⳊⲼⳂⳔ ⳭⳢⳄ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1482.62,"y":419.03,"cell":39345,"i":341,"name":"Nordrach Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802𐠂\udc2d\udc03\udc02\udc03\udc16𐠃\udc32𐠎\udc0c\udc1f𐠚\udc2b\udc3f\udc2d\udc14\udc26\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠝\udc0e\ud802𐠦𐠳𐠓\udc0f\udc22𐠧\ud802𐠈\udc2a\udc0b\udc28𐠂𐠒\ud802𐠗𐠒 \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠨\udc01\ud802𐠥\udc32\udc17\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":559.27,"y":759.2,"cell":77686,"i":342,"name":"Thorstad Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲲⳂ⳹ⳲⳢⳊⳌⳀⳠⳭⳜⳫⳄⳄⲶ⳾Ⳮ⳾⳾ⲶⳫⳈⲺⲴⳆⳈⳈⳖⳔⳤ⳩ⲺⳢⲺⳖⳤⳔ⳩Ⳓ⳪⳩ⳒⳀⳄⳁⳜⳠⲾ⳧ⲸⳄⳌⳲ⳪ⳒⲴⳘⳠ⳧⳾Ⳮⳁⳃ⳾</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":105.9,"y":818.3,"cell":79496,"i":343,"name":"Sa Yen Cau Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> \ud802\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠋𐠩\ud802𐠋\udc01\udc1e\udc05\udc05\udc23\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠌𐠥\udc21\udc2a\udc10\udc1b\udc22\ud802  \udc3c\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠧𐠋\udc25\udc33\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠦𐠈𐠊\udc34 \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠃\udc05\udc13\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":74